      "publishedAt": "2025-07-04T22:29:29Z",
      "body": "## What's Changed\r\n* Example for menus by @dex4er in https://github.com/freelensapp/freelens-example-extension/pull/72\r\n* Refactoring: ExtensionKubeObject is a base for resource classes and it reduced the core and complexity for K8s classes by @dex4er in https://github.com/freelensapp/freelens-example-extension/pull/75\r\n* Refactoring: try/catch in all components for better error handling by @dex4er in https://github.com/freelensapp/freelens-example-extension/pull/76\r\n\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/freelensapp/freelens-example-extension/compare/v1.4.0...v1.4.1",
