      "isPrerelease": false,
      "notes": "## What's Changed\r\n* CI: Use Turbo cache for tests and builds by @dex4er in https://github.com/freelensapp/freelens-example-extension/pull/178\r\n* Vite config as Javascript to not confuse type checks for application by @dex4er in https://github.com/freelensapp/freelens-example-extension/pull/179\r\n* CI: clean up workflows by @dex4er in https://github.com/freelensapp/freelens-example-extension/pull/181\r\n* CI: Correct pnpm to use Github cache by @dex4er in https://github.com/freelensapp/freelens-example-extension/pull/182\r\n* Return the page for available version by @dex4er in https://github.com/freelensapp/freelens-example-extension/pull/183\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/freelensapp/freelens-example-extension/compare/v1.6.1...v1.6.2"
