    {
      "version": "v1.4.2",
      "name": "v1.4.2",
      "publishedAt": "2025-07-05T23:18:24Z",
      "isPrerelease": false,
      "notes": "## What's Changed\r\n* Use SCSS modules by @dex4er in https://github.com/freelensapp/freelens-example-extension/pull/78\r\n* Fix badge for boolean values by @dex4er in https://github.com/freelensapp/freelens-example-extension/pull/79\r\n\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/freelensapp/freelens-example-extension/compare/v1.4.1...v1.4.2"
    },
    {
      "version": "v1.4.1",
      "name": "v1.4.1",
      "publishedAt": "2025-07-04T22:29:29Z",
      "isPrerelease": false,
      "notes": "## What's Changed\r\n* Example for menus by @dex4er in https://github.com/freelensapp/freelens-example-extension/pull/72\r\n* Refactoring: ExtensionKubeObject is a base for resource classes and it reduced the core and complexity for K8s classes by @dex4er in https://github.com/freelensapp/freelens-example-extension/pull/75\r\n* Refactoring: try/catch in all components for better error handling by @dex4er in https://github.com/freelensapp/freelens-example-extension/pull/76\r\n\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/freelensapp/freelens-example-extension/compare/v1.4.0...v1.4.1"
    },
    {
      "version": "v1.4.0",
      "name": "v1.4.0",
      "publishedAt": "2025-06-29T22:31:35Z",
      "isPrerelease": false,
      "notes": "## What's Changed\r\n* Example preferences; k8s api in common by @dex4er in https://github.com/freelensapp/freelens-example-extension/pull/57\r\n* Update to API 1.4.0 by @dex4er in https://github.com/freelensapp/freelens-example-extension/pull/66\r\n* Use functions rather than classes for React components by @dex4er in https://github.com/freelensapp/freelens-example-extension/pull/67\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/freelensapp/freelens-example-extension/compare/v1.3.0...v1.4.0"
    },
    {
      "version": "v1.3.0",
      "name": "v1.3.0",
      "publishedAt": "2025-06-09T21:48:18Z",
      "isPrerelease": false,
      "notes": "## What's Changed\r\n* View for Example CRD by @dex4er in https://github.com/freelensapp/freelens-example-extension/pull/47\r\n\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/freelensapp/freelens-example-extension/compare/v1.2.0...v1.3.0"
    },
    {
      "version": "v1.2.0",
      "name": "v1.2.0",
      "publishedAt": "2025-05-15T14:35:31Z",
      "isPrerelease": false,
      "notes": "## What's Changed\r\n* Build using Vite by @dex4er in https://github.com/freelensapp/freelens-extension-example/pull/29\r\n* Update pnpm to v10.11.0 by @renovate in https://github.com/freelensapp/freelens-extension-example/pull/33\r\n* Update dependency knip to v5.56.0 by @renovate in https://github.com/freelensapp/freelens-extension-example/pull/32\r\n* Update dependency @types/node to ^22.15.18 by @renovate in https://github.com/freelensapp/freelens-extension-example/pull/31\r\n\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/freelensapp/freelens-extension-example/compare/v1.0.1...v1.2.0"
    },
    {
