      "isPrerelease": false,
      "notes": "## What's Changed\r\n* Update dependency @types/node to ^22.15.17 by @renovate in https://github.com/freelensapp/freelens-extension-example/pull/22\r\n* Update dependency @freelensapp/extensions to ^1.3.0 by @renovate in https://github.com/freelensapp/freelens-extension-example/pull/24\r\n\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/freelensapp/freelens-extension-example/compare/v1.0.0...v1.0.1"
